<p>Tile shows every decision. A crooked first row, a sliver cut at the end of a wall or a grout line that wanders gets noticed every time you walk into the room. We plan tile the way we plan trim: layout first, so the pattern is centred where people look and the cuts fall where they won't. Zanini Renovations has been a fully insured carpentry and renovation business in Carleton Place since 2020.</p>

